{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡近日流傳一段車Cam片段，顯示兩名男子騎着疑為電動單車的車輛，於理工大學附近的紅磡暢運路上風馳電掣。期間其中一名騎者更無視天橋口設置的「禁止單車進入」標誌，直接駛上天橋，引發大批網民怒轟行為極度危險。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-25-10h17m48s455.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026biFWPnMbf01787624731.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-25-10h17m48s455.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-25-10h17m57s056.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/202644aE9lKXd51787624748.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-25-10h17m57s056.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">片段顯示，車Cam車輛當時正沿暢運路往紅磡港鐵站方向行駛。畫面中可見，兩名男子騎着疑似電動單車在前方行車線同向前進。當駛至分叉路口時，前方一名騎者轉左行駛，而另一名男子則繼續直線前行，直接駛上往紅磡站方向的天橋上斜路段。翻查現場環境，該座天橋的入口路段旁，豎立着十分清晰的圓形「禁止單車進入」交通標誌。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-24 下午4.43.29.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026qrDVv0Tafo1787624779.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Google Map圖片\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">Google Map圖片</span>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">影片曝光後隨即引發網絡熱議，大批網民紛紛留言指責涉事騎者行為危險及無視法例，怒轟：「轉左都算了，仲上埋橋」、「周街橫衝直撞」。此外，亦有熟悉該區路況的網民透露此類違規情況並非首次發生，坦言：「好少事 呢條路成日見」、「慣犯」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T02:35:48.262012+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":381,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}